                    {
                        "sense_id": "71074a59-1ec4-321a-a4c8-e15aa245edeb",
                        "entry_id": "c8941c50-d778-326b-aa7c-4b4fab4ad11c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A young trout."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8f585fc-1ec1-47eb-a453-ee8f18a75bc8",
                                "sense_id": "71074a59-1ec4-321a-a4c8-e15aa245edeb",
                                "text": "The brook beneath, thro’ which the troutlet shy / Shot swiftly on, and baffled all his skill;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce9e0d81-768a-444e-bde2-21a668e4ed4a",
                                "sense_id": "71074a59-1ec4-321a-a4c8-e15aa245edeb",
                                "text": "As, pent in an aquarium, the troutlet / Swims round and round his tank to find an outlet,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd089a38-2b87-4259-88f4-1facecde53e8",
                                "sense_id": "71074a59-1ec4-321a-a4c8-e15aa245edeb",
                                "text": "He has a nice taste in the arts that has come to him by the way of socks, spats and slips, and of these he has a large and happy collection, which he laughs at jollily in public […] but in the privacy of his chamber he sometimes spreads them out like troutlet on the river’s bank and has his quiet thrills of exultation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7569d07-6fca-4b7b-8573-deebdd6755fc",
                                "sense_id": "71074a59-1ec4-321a-a4c8-e15aa245edeb",
                                "text": "Farther along I came to a stream and, resting on its bank, counted many troutlets lying on the bottom among the stones."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fdea923f-c191-4a48-a3c2-3285b5dce221",
                        "source_entry_id": "c8941c50-d778-326b-aa7c-4b4fab4ad11c",
                        "source_sense_id": "71074a59-1ec4-321a-a4c8-e15aa245edeb",
